run/
run/contract/
luac.out
# What the chain writes against a world is not history. A leg plan is
# authored in front of a party, a bag and a walked graph, and the chain
# archives every one at its next start; the drafts rung's history and the
# archive are the same writing, kept on disk to be read, not in git.
# The outline, the policy and the hand plans stay tracked: banked luck.
plans/leg_*.json
plans/drafts/
plans/archive/
plans/stale.*/
plans/shelved/
__pycache__/
# Snapshots the scripts take of the outline before a hand edit or at a
# chain start, the candidate outlines draw_outlines.sh drafts, and the
# dated leg and archive dirs a hand move leaves behind. The named
# snapshots already tracked (prePerfect, retired, the perfect outline)
# stay tracked; ignore rules do not touch a tracked file.
plans/outline.[0-9]*
plans/outline.done.[0-9]*
plans/candidates/
plans/archive-*/
plans/legs.*/
